; Documentation from the grammar. This backend takes the grammar as well as
; the facts, because a manual shows the grammar as the author wrote it.
;
; handsome is here because a formatted example has to be laid out and then
; marked up, and a rendered stream lets one document do both. Nothing here
; emits code or configuration, so there is no ppxlib and no JSON.

(library
 (name docs)
 (public_name lingo.docs)
 (libraries core scopes handsome redfa))
